     "\r\n  \r\n    \r\n  \r\n  <div bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\" text=\"#000000\">\r\n    <a href=\"https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hackathon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hackathon&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793243488429000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1-GTQCOcnJvxA0phWfkTlx\">https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hackathon</a><br>\r\n    <br>\r\n    Mas info aqui:\r\n    <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/#!topic/sevillarusers/RUUyC_aF9LY\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/%23!topic/sevillarusers/RUUyC_aF9LY&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793243488429000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3tHK9Kb4PaKdv8luQJTh3Y\">https://groups.google.com/forum/#!topic/sevillarusers/RUUyC_aF9LY</a><br>\r\n    <br>\r\n    Contamos contigo! :)</div>"
